---
import Layout from '../layouts/BlogPost.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="About Mechveck"
	description="Reviews and guides for AI tools, productivity software, and technology"
	pubDate={new Date('January 11 2026')}
>
	<p>
		<strong>Mechveck</strong> is your guide to the best AI tools and productivity software.
		We test, review, and compare the tools that help you work smarter and get more done.
	</p>

	<h2>What We Cover</h2>
	<p>
		Our focus areas include:
	</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>AI Writing Tools</strong> - From content generation to email automation</li>
		<li><strong>Productivity Software</strong> - Project management, note-taking, and collaboration</li>
		<li><strong>SEO Tools</strong> - Keyword research, competitor analysis, and optimization</li>
		<li><strong>Automation</strong> - Workflows, integrations, and time-saving solutions</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Our Approach</h2>
	<p>
		Every article is written with hands-on experience. We don't just list features - we test
		tools in real workflows and tell you what actually works. Our goal is to help you make
		informed decisions without wading through marketing fluff.
	</p>

	<h2>Stay Updated</h2>
	<p>
		The AI and productivity space moves fast. Check back regularly for new reviews, comparisons,
		and guides. You can also follow us on <a href="https://github.com/mechveck">GitHub</a>.
	</p>
</Layout>
